This product works with LabMCP (https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/lab-instrument-mcps),
open-source MCP servers for laboratory instruments by K-Dense, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSES/LabMCP-LICENSE). LabMCP servers
are not bundled: the runner launches the published packages (uvx labmcp-...).

src/rhylthyme_labmcp/catalog/labmcp-catalog.json contains material derived from
LabMCP: the tool names, kinds, descriptions and input schemas and the safety
limits of each LabMCP server package, as the servers report them in --simulate
mode, exported by scripts/export_catalog.py at the versions it records.
Modified only by selection and layout.

src/rhylthyme_labmcp/_vendor/scpi_policy.py is LabMCP's
servers/protocols/scpi-instrument/src/labmcp_scpi/policy.py at commit 46545ea
(labmcp-scpi 0.1.3), modified only to define SafetyLimitError locally instead
of importing it from the labmcp package.

rhylthyme-labmcp is not affiliated with or endorsed by K-Dense.
"LabMCP" is used here only to identify the software this package works with.
